\frametitle{Inner algorithm in C++}
C++ code for the inner algorithm using {\tt Rcpp}:
	\scriptsize
\begin{verbatim}
Rcpp::cppFunction(
"
int Mandel(double real, double im, int max_iter = 100)
{
  std::complex<double> c(real, im);
  std::complex<double> z = c;
  for (int i=0; i< max_iter; i++){
    z = z * z + c;
    if (std::abs(z) > 2) {
      return i;
    }
  }
  return max_iter;
}
"
)
\end{verbatim}
